  "releaseNotes": "0.7.12 fixes dust removal: RemoveDust keeps detail larger than a speck (in 0.7.11 it erased slanted letters of a licence plate) and replaces the ring around a speck, and DevelopNegative removes no dust by default (NegativeOptions.DustSize = 0). Includes everything of 0.7.11, which was not published to NuGet: film negatives (AnalyzeNegative, DevelopNegative, InvertNegative, NegativeCalibration), Curves, WhiteBalance(Rgba32), AutoWhiteBalance, RemoveDust and ReduceColorNoise. Existing API and results unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.7.12/docs/releases/release-0.7.12.md",
